<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong branch, said on Friday it has launched 138 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$32.67	 PREMIUM	   10.33 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.738	 GEARING	   4.92x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  5,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 28.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$36.30	 LISTING DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
